{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Segal范畴Γ"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Segal 范畴 Γ"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>直接定义</h3>\n<p>Segal 范畴 $\\Gamma$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点"}},{"Plain":"有限集范畴的"},{"Local":{"url":"反范畴","text":"反范畴"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n\\Gamma := \\mathsf{Fin}_*^{\\mathrm{op}}.\r\n$$\n记其对象为 $\\underline{n} = \\{*,1,\\cdots,n\\}\\,(n\\geq 0)$.</p>\n<p>由定义, 范畴 $\\Gamma$ 的态射可描述如下: 态射 $\\underline{n} \\to \\underline{m}$ 将每个 $1\\leq i\\leq n$ 对应到 $\\{1,\\cdots,m\\}$ 的一个子集, 这些子集互不相交.</p>\n<h3>通过泛性质</h3>\n<p>称具有"},{"Local":{"url":"零对象","text":"零对象"}},{"Plain":"和有限"},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":"的范畴为<strong>半加性范畴</strong>.</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>. Segal 范畴 $\\Gamma$ 是一个对象生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"半加性范畴.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>Segal 范畴 $\\Gamma$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"零对象","text":"零对象"}},{"Plain":"为 $[0]$, "},{"Local":{"url":"积(范畴论)","text":"积"}},{"Plain":"为\n$$\r\n\\underline{n}\\times \\underline{m} = \\underline{n+m}.\r\n$$\n特别地,\n$$\r\n\\underline{n} = \\underline{1}^{\\times n}.\r\n$$\n这说明 $\\Gamma$ 是一个 "},{"Local":{"url":"Lawvere理论","text":"Lawvere 理论"}},{"Plain":". 事实上, 它正是"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点对象"}},{"Plain":"的 Lawvere 理论.</p>\n<h3>与单纯形范畴的关系</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"单纯形范畴","text":"单纯形范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\Delta$ 到 $\\Gamma$ 有一函子, 将对象 $[n]\\in\\Delta$ 对应到 $\\underline{n}\\in\\Gamma$. 详见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Segal函子γ","text":"Segal 函子 $\\gamma$"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}